    "formulation": {
      "role": "example-definition",
      "latex": [
        "\\mu\\frac{dI}{d\\tau}+I=0,\\qquad I(\\tau,\\mu)=e^{-\\tau/\\mu}",
        "F_{\\rm out}=2\\pi\\int_0^1\\mu e^{-\\tau/\\mu}d\\mu=2\\pi E_3(\\tau)"
      ],
      "note": {
        "ja": "正のGauss–Legendre離散方向と1次風上有限体積の空間行進を使います。角度誤差だけを分ける系列では、一定セル内を指数関数で正確に伝播します。",
        "en": "Use positive Gauss–Legendre ordinates and first-order upstream finite-volume marching. A separate angular-error sweep uses exact exponential propagation within each constant cell."
      },
      "url": {
        "ja": "https://hrkoyama.github.io/numerical-methods-atlas/validation/radiation-transport/?lang=ja#radiation-transport-ja-algorithm",
        "en": "https://hrkoyama.github.io/numerical-methods-atlas/validation/radiation-transport/?lang=en#radiation-transport-en-algorithm"
      }
